            <name>ReduceShipmentByReference</name>
            <id>2316</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Received goods</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>کالای دریافت‌شده</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Поступившие товары</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Giren ürünler</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Hàng hóa tiếp nhận</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Received goods</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Received goods</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>Object.ReduceShipmentByReference</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>ReduceShipmentByReferenceOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>ReduceShipmentByReferenceExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>2318</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>When selecting &quot;Ship again, execute the reference&quot;, you will need to ship the goods shipped under the sales order again.

In all other cases, as well as when selecting &quot;Do not ship, reduce reference&quot;, additional shipment will not be required.
</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>هنگام انتخاب &quot;ارسال مجدد، اجرای مرجع&quot;، باید کالای ارسال‌شده تحت سفارش فروش را دوباره ارسال کنید.

در همه موارد دیگر، و همچنین هنگام انتخاب &quot;ارسال نشود، کاهش مرجع&quot;، ارسال تکمیلی لازم نخواهد بود.
</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>При выборе варианта &quot;Отгрузить вновь, выполнить распоряжение&quot; потребуется повторная отгрузка для товаров, отгруженных по заказу клиента.

Во всех остальных случаях, а также при выборе варианта &quot;Не отгружать, уменьшить распоряжение&quot; повторная отгрузка не потребуется.
</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>&quot;Yeniden gönder, siparişi tamamla&quot; seçeneğini seçtiğinizde, bir müşteri siparişi kapsamında gönderilen ürünler için yeniden sevkiyat yapılması gerekecektir.

Diğer tüm durumlarda ve &quot;Gönderilmesin, siparişi azalt&quot; seçeneğini seçildiğinde, yeniden sevkiyat yapılması gerekmeyecektir.
</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Khi chọn phương án &quot;Giao hàng lại, thực hiện lệnh&quot;, thì sẽ cần giao hàng lại đối với hàng hóa đã giao theo đơn hàng của khách.

Trong tất cả các trường hợp còn lại, cũng như khi chọn phương án &quot;Không giao lại, giảm lệnh&quot; thì sẽ không cần giao hàng lại.
</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>When selecting &quot;Ship again, execute the reference&quot;, you will need to ship the goods shipped under the sales order again.

In all other cases, as well as when selecting &quot;Do not ship, reduce reference&quot;, additional shipment will not be required.
</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>When selecting &quot;Ship again, execute the reference&quot;, you will need to ship the goods shipped under the sales order again.

In all other cases, as well as when selecting &quot;Do not ship, reduce reference&quot;, additional shipment will not be required.
</value>
              </title>
              <formatted>true</formatted>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>ReduceShipmentByReferenceContextMenu</name>
              <id>2317</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
